      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You're still confused, but Willie ignores your confusion and hops
          on anyways. "Whatever man, just kick it into high gear so we can get Justin.
          Heard he's been ready since 6 AM."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
