      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'As you pick Willie up, he greets you with a toothy grin. He''s wearing
          the same thing he always wears: Levi jeans, a dirty white tanktop, and
          his Tims, which he paid extra to modify with wheelies. His watch and chain
          necklaces beam the sun into your eyes.'
        type: 0
        typeString: 
